    "PROGRAM_MOUNT_USAGE": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Makes a real folder on your Mac accessible as a DOS drive.\n\nUsage:    \u001b[34;1mmount [DOS drive letter] [\"Path/to/real/folder\"]\u001b[0m\n\nExamples: \u001b[32;1mmount d \"/Users/yourname/Desktop/\"\u001b[0m\n          ...will make your macOS desktop folder accessible to DOS as drive D.\n          \u001b[32;1mmount -u d\u001b[0m will remove drive D.\n\nBy default, the folder will be mounted as an emulated hard drive.\nTo mount the folder as a CD-ROM drive, add \u001b[32;1m-t cdrom\u001b[0m to the command.\nTo mount it as a floppy drive, add \u001b[32;1m-t floppy\u001b[0m.\n"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hace accesible una carpeta real de su Mac como una unidad DOS.\n\nUso:      \u001b[34;1mmount [letra de unidad DOS] [\"ruta/a/carpeta/real\"]\u001b[0m\n\nEjemplos: \u001b[32;1mmount d \"/Users/yourname/Desktop/\"\u001b[0m\n          ...harÃ¡ accesible en DOS su escritorio de macOS como la unidad D.\n          \u001b[32;1mmount -u d\u001b[0m extraerÃ¡ la unidad D.\n\nPor defecto, la carpeta se montarÃ¡ como un disco duro emulado.\nPara montar la carpeta como una unidad de CD-ROM, aÃ±ada \u001b[32;1m-t cdrom\u001b[0m al comando.\nPara montarla como una unidad de disquete, aÃ±ada \u001b[32;1m-t floppy\u001b[0m.\n"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rend accessible un dossier rÃ©el de votre Mac en tant que lecteur DOS.\n\nUsage :    \u001b[34;1mmount [lettre DOS] [\"Chemin/du/dossier/rÃ©el\"]\u001b[0m\n\nExemples : \u001b[32;1mmount d \"/Users/votrenom/Desktop/\"\u001b[0m rendra accessible\n\t\t   Ã  DOS votre dossier du bureau macOS en tant que lecteur D.\n\t\t   \u001b[32;1mmount -u d\u001b[0m supprimera le lecteur D.\n\nPar dÃ©faut, le dossier sera montÃ© en tant que disque dur Ã©mulÃ©.\nPour monter le dossier en tant que lecteur CD-ROM, ajoutez \u001b[32;1m-t cdrom\u001b[0m\nÃ  la commande.\nPour monter en tant que lecteur de disquettes, ajoutez \u001b[32;1m-t floppy\u001b[0m.\n"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Makes a real folder on your Mac accessible as a DOS drive.\n\nUsage:    \u001b[34;1mmount [DOS drive letter] [\"Path/to/real/folder\"]\u001b[0m\n\nExamples: \u001b[32;1mmount d \"/Users/yourname/Desktop/\"\u001b[0m\n          ...will make your macOS desktop folder accessible to DOS as drive D.\n          \u001b[32;1mmount -u d\u001b[0m will remove drive D.\n\nBy default, the folder will be mounted as an emulated hard drive.\nTo mount the folder as a CD-ROM drive, add \u001b[32;1m-t cdrom\u001b[0m to the command.\nTo mount it as a floppy drive, add \u001b[32;1m-t floppy\u001b[0m.\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
